PTX LB-self+alias+fence.sc+weak-store
"One thread loads global x through its alias y (relaxed, .sys), runs two fence.sc, then stores 1 to x with a weak store. As in LB-self+alias+fence.sc, but the store is weak: a release pattern through a fence ends with a strong write (8.8), so the load observes no release and the fences do not synchronize; with no alias fence nothing orders the load before the store: allowed."
{
x=0;
y @ generic aliases x;
P0:r0=0;
}
 P0@cta 0,gpu 0              ;
 ld.relaxed.sys r0, y        ;
 fence.sc.sys                ;
 fence.sc.sys                ;
 st.weak x, 1                ;
exists
(P0:r0 == 1)
